### 4. CREATE DOCTOR SCHEDULE
POST http://localhost:4004/api/doctors/1f2e3d4c-5b61-4c32-b1a0-d9e8f7a6b5c4/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workDate": "2026-04-10",
  "startTime": "08:00",
  "endTime": "12:00",
  "isAvailable": true
}

### 5. CREATE APPOINTMENT
POST http://localhost:4004/api/appointment
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "a1e1b2c3-d4f5-6789-0123-456789abcdef",
  "patientId": "7f9e8d7c-6b5a-4e3d-2c1b-0a0b0c0d0e0f",
  "doctorId": "1f2e3d4c-5b61-4c32-b1a0-d9e8f7a6b5c4",
  "appointmentDate": "2026-04-10",
  "startTime": "09:00",
  "endTime": "09:30",
  "status": "SCHEDULED"
}

