### 7. CREATE BILLING ACCOUNT
POST http://localhost:4004/api/billing/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "7f9e8d7c-6b5a-4e3d-2c1b-0a0b0c0d0e0f",
  "name": "Trần Thị B",
  "email": "patientB@example.com",
  "balance": 1000000,
  "currency": "VND"
}
